+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    The DHCP agent no longer reports a network's ports as DHCP-ready when
+    the network's dnsmasq process failed to start or to restart, and no
+    longer caches a network whose dnsmasq failed to start. It schedules a
+    resync for the network instead, and reports the ports once the DHCP
+    service is running.
